OL,3,GNEWSAAirbnb cleaning rule changes will
OL,4,A'absolutely' hit Wales harder, says
OL,5,Ahost
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn Airbnb host has said rule changes
OL,8,Fmeaning guests cannot be asked to do
OL,9,Fcertain jobs will put "more stress" on
OL,10,Fhosts.
OL,12,FHosts cannot ask guests to do jobs
OL,13,Fnormally carried out by cleaners,
OL,14,Fincluding doing dishes, stripping beds
OL,15,Fand taking rubbish off site.
OL,17,FGavin Rowlands, 37, owns a property in
OL,18,FNeath Port Talbot with his wife Kelly,
OL,19,Fand said Wales would "absolutely" be
OL,20,Fhit harder due to specific rules.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
