OL,3,GNEWSAAirbnb cleaning rule changes will
OL,4,A'absolutely' hit Wales harder, says
OL,5,Ahost
OL,6,
OL,7,FHere, holiday let owners pay more
OL,8,Fcouncil tax if properties are not
OL,9,Favailable for at least 252 days and let
OL,10,Ffor at least 182 days a year, which can
OL,11,Fsee hosts strive for more same-day
OL,12,Fchangeovers between guests.
